{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-iot-architecture","title":"工业互联网架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/information-technology-integration/industrial-iot-architecture","wordCount":1563,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"工业互联网架构\">工业互联网架构</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><h3 id=\"opc-ua-统一架构\">OPC UA 统一架构</h3><p>OPC UA（Open Platform Communications Unified Architecture）是工业通信的国际标准框架，提供跨平台、跨厂商的安全数据交互能力，是智能制造信息集成的基石协议。</p>\n<p>OPC UA 的地址空间模型将工业设备的所有信息组织为节点（Node）的层次图结构，每个节点通过 NodeId 唯一标识：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;OPC UA 服务器&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;对象节点 Objects&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;类型节点 Types&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;视图节点 Views&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;设备对象&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[&quot;变量: 温度&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B3[&quot;变量: 转速&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B4[&quot;方法: 启动&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;设备类型定义&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;数据类型定义&quot;]&#10;    B1 -.-&gt;|&quot;HasTypeDefinition&quot;| C1\">graph TD\n    A[\"OPC UA 服务器\"] --&gt; B[\"对象节点 Objects\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"类型节点 Types\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"视图节点 Views\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"设备对象\"]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[\"变量: 温度\"]\n    B1 --&gt; B3[\"变量: 转速\"]\n    B1 --&gt; B4[\"方法: 启动\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"设备类型定义\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"数据类型定义\"]\n    B1 -.-&gt;|\"HasTypeDefinition\"| C1</pre><p>OPC UA 支持两种通信模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>客户端/服务器模式</strong>：请求-响应式数据访问，适用于监控和配置</li>\n<li><strong>发布/订阅模式</strong>（Pub/Sub）：基于 UDP 或 MQTT 的高效数据分发，适用于大规模实时数据采集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>信息模型的核心优势在于语义互操作。通过伴随规范（Companion Specification），各行业定义标准化的设备信息模型，如 PackML 用于包装机械、Euromap 用于注塑机、umati 用于机床。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间敏感网络\">时间敏感网络</h3><p>时间敏感网络（TSN）是一组 IEEE 802.1 标准的集合，在标准以太网基础上增加了确定性传输能力，满足工业控制对时延和抖动的严格要求。</p>\n<p>TSN 的关键标准包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>典型时延</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IEEE 802.1AS</td>\n<td>时间同步</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 1\\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IEEE 802.1Qbv</td>\n<td>时间感知调度</td>\n<td>确定性转发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IEEE 802.1Qbu</td>\n<td>帧抢占</td>\n<td>减少低优先级干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IEEE 802.1CB</td>\n<td>帧复制消除</td>\n<td>冗余可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间感知调度器（TAS）通过门控列表（Gate Control List）实现确定性流量调度。每个出口队列的传输窗口由门控状态决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{e2e} = d_{prop} + \\sum_{i=1}^{n} d_{switch,i} + d_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{prop}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为传播延迟，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{switch,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为交换机 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的处理延迟，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为排队延迟。在 TAS 调度下，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可降至接近零。</p>\n<p>TSN 正在取代传统工业现场总线（如 PROFINET IRT、EtherCAT），实现 IT 和 OT 网络的融合统一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"边缘计算与云边协同\">边缘计算与云边协同</h3><p>边缘计算将数据处理能力从云端下沉到靠近数据源的网络边缘，解决工业场景中实时性、带宽和隐私的约束。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;设备层&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;原始数据&quot;| B[&quot;边缘层&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;聚合数据&quot;| C[&quot;云平台&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;模型/策略&quot;| B&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;控制指令&quot;| A&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;边缘功能&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;数据预处理&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;实时推理&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[&quot;本地存储&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D4[&quot;协议转换&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"设备层\"] --&gt;|\"原始数据\"| B[\"边缘层\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"聚合数据\"| C[\"云平台\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"模型/策略\"| B\n    B --&gt;|\"控制指令\"| A\n    B --&gt; D[\"边缘功能\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"数据预处理\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"实时推理\"]\n    D --&gt; D3[\"本地存储\"]\n    D --&gt; D4[\"协议转换\"]</pre><p>边缘-云协同的任务卸载决策可建模为优化问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\left( w_1 \\cdot T_i + w_2 \\cdot E_i \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>约束条件：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i \\leq T_{deadline}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（时延约束），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum E_i \\leq E_{budget}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（能耗约束）</p>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的完成时延，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为能耗，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1, w_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为权重。</p>\n<p>工业边缘计算平台的典型功能包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>协议适配</strong>：将 Modbus、PROFINET、EtherCAT 等 OT 协议转换为 MQTT/HTTP</li>\n<li><strong>数据清洗</strong>：滤除噪声、插值缺失值、对齐多源时间戳</li>\n<li><strong>边缘推理</strong>：运行轻量化 AI 模型进行设备状态判断</li>\n<li><strong>断网缓存</strong>：在网络中断时本地存储数据，恢复后自动上传</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"工业互联网平台架构\">工业互联网平台架构</h3><p>工业互联网平台是面向制造业的操作系统，向下连接海量设备，向上支撑工业应用开发。其参考架构包含四个核心层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>边缘层</strong>：设备接入、协议解析、数据采集</li>\n<li><strong>IaaS 层</strong>：计算、存储、网络资源池化</li>\n<li><strong>PaaS 层</strong>：数据管理、AI 引擎、开发工具、微服务框架</li>\n<li><strong>SaaS 层</strong>：面向具体场景的工业 APP（能效管理、预测维护、供应链协同）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>平台的核心技术指标包括设备接入规模（百万级）、数据处理吞吐率（GB/s 级）、API 调用延迟（&lt;100ms）和应用开发周期（周级别缩短至天级别）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工业网络安全\">工业网络安全</h3><p>工业互联网的安全架构遵循纵深防御原则，区别于传统 IT 安全的特殊要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可用性优先</strong>：OT 系统要求 7×24 不间断运行，安全措施不能影响生产</li>\n<li><strong>长生命周期</strong>：工业设备可能运行 15-20 年，需应对不断演变的威胁</li>\n<li><strong>安全与实时性平衡</strong>：加解密操作不能引入不可接受的通信延迟</li>\n</ul>\n<p>IEC 62443 标准定义了工业自动化安全的层次化策略，通过区域（Zone）和管道（Conduit）划分安全域，实施访问控制和流量监测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025-2026年，工业互联网领域最显著的趋势是 5G 专网在工厂环境的规模部署。5G URLLC 模式提供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;1ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的端到端时延和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99.999</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99.999\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.999%</span></span></span></span></span> 可靠性，正在替代部分有线连接实现产线柔性化重构。</p>\n<p>确定性网络（DetNet）标准在 IETF 层面取得进展，TSN 从局域网扩展到广域网，使跨厂区的确定性通信成为可能。这对于分布式协同制造和远程控制场景具有重要价值。</p>\n<p>工业大模型的兴起推动边缘计算平台的能力升级——边缘节点开始部署压缩后的大语言模型，支持自然语言交互式设备诊断和工艺知识问答，降低了一线操作人员使用智能系统的门槛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>对比 OPC UA Pub/Sub 与传统客户端/服务器模式在百台设备数据采集场景下的性能差异，分析各自适用的工业场景。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某产线控制回路要求端到端延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 1ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>μ</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 100\\mu s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>。设计 TSN 网络方案，说明需要启用哪些 TSN 标准及其配置要点。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个边缘-云协同的预测性维护系统架构，明确边缘节点和云平台各自承担的计算任务及其依据。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论 5G 专网与 WiFi 6 在工厂无线通信场景中的优劣势，分析不同应用场景的最佳选择。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>工业互联网架构是智能制造的信息高速公路，提供了设备互联、数据流动和应用承载的完整技术栈。OPC UA 解决了语义互操作问题，TSN 提供了确定性传输保障，边缘计算实现了实时响应与弹性扩展的平衡。理解这一架构体系是构建数字孪生、实施工业大数据分析和部署智能应用的必要前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"工业互联网架构","id":"工业互联网架构"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"OPC UA 统一架构","id":"opc-ua-统一架构"},{"level":3,"text":"时间敏感网络","id":"时间敏感网络"},{"level":3,"text":"边缘计算与云边协同","id":"边缘计算与云边协同"},{"level":3,"text":"工业互联网平台架构","id":"工业互联网平台架构"},{"level":3,"text":"工业网络安全","id":"工业网络安全"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"精密测量与质量工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/manufacturing-science-foundations/precision-measurement-quality"},"next":{"title":"数字孪生技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/smart-manufacturing/information-technology-integration/digital-twin-technology"}}